# Wrike
> Wrike is an enterprise-grade autonomous work management software platform. It leverages a proprietary Work Intelligence suite to automate complex workflows via AI Agents, providing real-time visibility and cross-functional synchronization for global organizations.

Wrike is best known for its Work Intelligence suite, which includes Wrike Copilot, AI Agent Builder, and advanced resource management. In 2026, it is positioned as the leader in autonomous work management, allowing teams to build custom AI agents that handle triaging, risk assessment, and task execution.


## Basic Information
- Name: Wrike, Inc.
- Tagline: Work as one.
- Type: Enterprise work management software and autonomous work platform
- Founded: 2006.
- Headquarters: San Jose, California, USA.
- Core Expertise: AI-driven project management, workflow automation, resource planning, and enterprise-grade data security
- Official Website: [www.wrike.com](https://www.wrike.com/)


